\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces MIRA-Relay makes selected-only feedback part of the next decision loop. The selector starts from a fit-only immutable fallback and an online family/provider relay. A runtime ledger records the selected output and status; an independent frozen endpoint judge supplies the correctness label only after termination. The selected event waits until $\tau _t=t+1+D$; released challenger feedback updates the shared family residual and provider bias, while fallback feedback updates diagnostic ledgers only. The released state is visible at the first decision tick at or after $\tau _t$.}}{3}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:overview}{{1}{3}{MIRA-Relay makes selected-only feedback part of the next decision loop. The selector starts from a fit-only immutable fallback and an online family/provider relay. A runtime ledger records the selected output and status; an independent frozen endpoint judge supplies the correctness label only after termination. The selected event waits until $\tau _t=t+1+D$; released challenger feedback updates the shared family residual and provider bias, while fallback feedback updates diagnostic ledgers only. The released state is visible at the first decision tick at or after $\tau _t$}{figure.caption.5}{}}
