\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The selected-only lifecycle. At tick $t$, the call returns a runtime status and an independent frozen endpoint judge produces the correctness label after termination. The selected event waits $D$ ticks and cannot update state before $\tau _t=t+1+D$. Released challenger feedback updates the shared relay; fallback feedback updates ledgers only, and unselected outputs are never observed.}}{4}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:lifecycle}{{2}{4}{The selected-only lifecycle. At tick $t$, the call returns a runtime status and an independent frozen endpoint judge produces the correctness label after termination. The selected event waits $D$ ticks and cannot update state before $\tau _t=t+1+D$. Released challenger feedback updates the shared relay; fallback feedback updates ledgers only, and unselected outputs are never observed}{figure.caption.6}{}}
